<title>NORWAY: PGS 1996 net profits rise 39 pct.</title>
<headline>PGS 1996 net profits rise 39 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>			   (millions of U.S. dollars unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating income	     451	   vs	 318</p>
<p> Operating result		91	   vs	  58</p>
<p> Pre-tax result		  72	   vs	  52</p>
<p> After-tax result		50	   vs	  36</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian offshore services and seismic company is Petroleum Geo-Services ASA. A Reuter poll of seven analysts forecast an operating result of 597 million crowns and pre-tax profits of 464 million crowns. Four of the analysts recommended to hold the share, two said buy and one said sell.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
